  "definition_ja": "真の値に近い値。測定したり四捨五入したりして得られ、真の値との間に少し差がある。",
  "definition_en": "A value that is close to, but not exactly equal to, the true value. The symbol ≈ means \"is approximately equal to.\"",
  "latex": "\\sqrt{2} \\approx 1.414",
  "spoken_en": "the square root of two is approximately one point four one four",
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": "3.14 is just an approximation of pi, so your answer won't be exact.",
      "ja": "3.14 は π の近似値にすぎないから、答えはぴったりにはならないよ。",
      "register": "spoken"
    },
    {
      "en": "Use a calculator to find an approximate value of √7 to the nearest hundredth.",
      "ja": "電卓を使い、√7 の近似値を小数第 3 位を四捨五入して求めよ。",
      "register": "written"
    }
  ],
  "collocations": [],
  "pitfalls": [
    "≈ は approximately equal to と読み、文の中では is approximately と言う（π ≈ 3.14 は pi is approximately 3.14）。",
    "四捨五入などで丸めた数（概数）は rounded number とも言う（エントリ round）。",
    "approximate は形容詞（approximate value、近似の）と動詞（近似する）の両方で使い、語末の発音が違う（形容詞は「〜メット」に近く弱く、動詞は「〜メイト」）。"
  ],
